  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Principle",
      "items": [
        "Untrusted hints, independent verification: hints from GET /proof/:postHash or a proof bundle only say where to look",
        "Everything is re-derived from an Arweave gateway, public RPCs and config/trusted-keys.json"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Verdicts",
      "items": [
        "anchored: inclusion proven under a trusted relayer inside its validity window",
        "pending inside deadline: not found yet, anchorBy not reached",
        "deadline passed, not scanned: anchorBy passed, bounded scan not run",
        "omitted: bounded scan completed and the postHash is absent; never derived from hints alone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Limits",
      "items": [
        "The Verify page is a convenience: the platform serves both the code and its copy of trusted-keys.json",
        "Receipts make omission provable; sigCommit lets genuine authors prove authorship. Neither prevents the platform from fabricating posts: that requires the per-batch validity proof (future work)."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
